        <mxCell id="note" value="Why two agent modules:&#xa;app/agent.py uses ADK McpToolset (tool auto-discovery) — great locally under `adk web`,&#xa;but it holds an open TextIOWrapper, and Agent Engine deploys by cloudpickling the agent.&#xa;app/agent_direct.py therefore re-implements the MCP client over plain requests, and is what ships." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
